            </style></head><body><div xmlns="" class="page-wrapper"><h2 class="auth__title">Приказ об ежегодном отпуске</h2><div class="doc-snippet">
  Приказ об ежегодном отпуске оформляется на основании утвержденного графика отпусков или заявления работника. Если уведомления о начале отпуска у вас не предусмотрены, приказ оформите не позднее чем за 15 дней до даты начала отпуска и ознакомьте с ним работника под подпись. Если оформляете отдельные уведомления, приказ на отпуск составьте не позднее чем за один день до даты начала отпуска. 
</div><div class="page-box" id="doc-box"><div class="doc-page"><div id="documentConftent" class="content content-form"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/118/202722/dfasrb3zy7/" data-dfa="dfasrb3zy7"></a><strong><span class="fill"><a data-anchor="/document/118/202722/bssPhr1/"></a>ОБЩЕСТВО С&nbsp;ОГРАНИЧЕННОЙ ОТВЕТСТВЕННОСТЬЮ </span><span class="fill"><span class="fill">«</span>БАРАКА САВДО</span><span class="fill">»</span><span class="fill"></span></strong></p><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/118/202722/bssPhr2/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/202722/dfasfed8pr/" data-dfa="dfasfed8pr"></a><strong>ПРИКАЗ</strong></p><div align="left"><table width="100%"><tbody><tr><td style="text-align: left; vertical-align: top; width: 121px;"><a data-anchor="/document/118/202722/bssPhr3/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/202722/dfas8s2o6t/" data-dfa="dfas8s2o6t"></a>г. <span class="fill">Ташкент</span></td><td style="vertical-align: top; text-align: center; width: 55.07%;"><strong><span class="fill"><a data-anchor="/document/118/202722/bssPhr4/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/202722/dfasgieutg/" data-dfa="dfasgieutg"></a>№&nbsp;15-отп</span></strong></td><td style="vertical-align: top; text-align: right; width: 26.28%;"><span class="fill"><a data-anchor="/document/118/202722/dfas2be0y0/" data-dfa="dfas2be0y0"></a></span><span class="fill"><span class="fill"><day>29</day>.<month>09</month>.<year>2026</year></span></span></td></tr></tbody></table></div><p><a data-anchor="/document/118/202722/bssPhr6/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/202722/dfas1bohrt/" data-dfa="dfas1bohrt"></a><strong>О&nbsp;предоставлении ежегодного</strong><br><strong>основного трудового отпуска</strong></p><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/118/202722/bssPhr7/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/202722/dfasudidhz/" data-dfa="dfasudidhz"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/202722/dfasbzavw2/" data-dfa="dfasbzavw2"></a>ПРИКАЗЫВАЮ:</p><p><a data-anchor="/document/118/202722/bssPhr8/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/202722/dfasdtp50m/" data-dfa="dfasdtp50m"></a>Предоставить <span class="fill">Кудратову Кариму Раззаковичу</span>, инженеру <span class="fill">ПТО</span>, трудовой отпуск за период работы с <span class="fill"><span class="fill"><day>29</day>.<month>09</month>.<year>2026</year></span>&nbsp;</span>по <span class="fill"><span class="fill"><day>29</day>.<month>09</month>.<year>2026</year></span></span>&nbsp;в количестве 21 календарного дня, а также 2 дня дополнительного отпуска за стаж работы в организации по статье 220 ТК, итого 23 календарных дня с <span class="fill">09</span><span class="fill"><span class="fill">.</span>02.2026</span>&nbsp;по <span class="fill">03.03.2026</span>.</p><p style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/118/202722/bssPhr9/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/202722/dfasc9e0gm/" data-dfa="dfasc9e0gm"></a>Выход на работу <span class="fill"></span><span class="fill"><day>29</day>.<month>09</month>.<year>2026</year></span>&nbsp;года.</p><div><table width="100%"><tbody><tr><td style="vertical-align: middle; width: 180px;"><a data-anchor="/document/118/202722/bssPhr10/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/202722/dfas1ol0cl/" data-dfa="dfas1ol0cl"></a><strong>Основание:</strong></td><td style="vertical-align: middle; width: 280px;"><a data-anchor="/document/118/202722/bssPhr11/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/202722/dfasnrkxp6/" data-dfa="dfasnrkxp6"></a>1. График отпусков.<span class="fill"></span></td></tr><tr><td style="vertical-align: middle; width: 180px;"><a data-anchor="/document/118/202722/dfasy0mgo1/" data-dfa="dfasy0mgo1"></a></td><td style="vertical-align: middle; width: 280px;"><a data-anchor="/document/118/202722/bssPhr12/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/202722/dfasgovmuy/" data-dfa="dfasgovmuy"></a>2. Заявление <span class="fill">К.Р. Кудратова</span></td></tr></tbody></table></div><div align="left"><table width="100%"><tbody><tr><td style="vertical-align: middle; width: 180px;"><a data-anchor="/document/118/202722/bssPhr13/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/202722/dfasaqk557/" data-dfa="dfasaqk557"></a><strong>Директор</strong></td><td class="bdBottom" style="vertical-align: middle; width: 280px; text-align: center;"><a data-anchor="/document/118/202722/dfasbbnu3i/" data-dfa="dfasbbnu3i"></a></td><td style="vertical-align: middle; text-align: center;"><span class="fill"></span></td><td class="bdBottom" style="vertical-align: middle; text-align: center;"><strong><span class="fill"><a data-anchor="/document/118/202722/bssPhr14/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/202722/dfasx69o81/" data-dfa="dfasx69o81"></a>Г.Г. Ибрагимов</span></strong></td></tr><tr><td style="vertical-align: middle; width: 180px;"><a data-anchor="/document/118/202722/dfaszvvtnz/" data-dfa="dfaszvvtnz"></a></td><td class="bdTop" style="vertical-align: middle; width: 280px; text-align: center;"><a data-anchor="/document/118/202722/bssPhr15/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/202722/dfas31agm9/" data-dfa="dfas31agm9"></a><sup>(подпись)</sup></td><td style="vertical-align: middle; text-align: center;"><span class="fill"></span></td><td class="bdTop" style="vertical-align: middle; text-align: center;"><a data-anchor="/document/118/202722/bssPhr16/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/202722/dfasynlh1k/" data-dfa="dfasynlh1k"></a><sup>(Ф.И.О)</sup></td></tr><tr><td style="vertical-align: middle; width: 180px;"><a data-anchor="/document/118/202722/bssPhr17/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/202722/dfas0pbp2h/" data-dfa="dfas0pbp2h"></a><strong>Внесено:</strong></td><td style="vertical-align: middle; width: 280px; text-align: center;"><span class="fill"></span></td><td style="vertical-align: middle; text-align: center;"><span class="fill"></span></td><td style="vertical-align: middle; text-align: center;"><a data-anchor="/document/118/202722/dfase6vkcm/" data-dfa="dfase6vkcm"></a></td></tr><tr><td style="vertical-align: middle; width: 180px;"><a data-anchor="/document/118/202722/bssPhr18/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/202722/dfas13knre/" data-dfa="dfas13knre"></a>Начальник ОК</td><td class="bdBottom" style="vertical-align: middle; width: 280px; text-align: center;"><a data-anchor="/document/118/202722/dfas69iqbh/" data-dfa="dfas69iqbh"></a></td><td style="vertical-align: middle; text-align: center;"><span class="fill"></span></td><td class="bdBottom" style="vertical-align: middle; text-align: center;"><span class="fill"><a data-anchor="/document/118/202722/bssPhr19/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/202722/dfass6bo5u/" data-dfa="dfass6bo5u"></a>И.И. Жалолов</span></td></tr><tr><td style="vertical-align: middle; width: 180px;"><a data-anchor="/document/118/202722/dfas45xqeg/" data-dfa="dfas45xqeg"></a></td><td class="bdTop" style="vertical-align: middle; width: 280px; text-align: center;"><a data-anchor="/document/118/202722/bssPhr20/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/202722/dfas0ogig1/" data-dfa="dfas0ogig1"></a><sup>(подпись)</sup><span class="fill"></span></td><td style="vertical-align: middle; text-align: center;"><span class="fill"></span></td><td class="bdTop" style="vertical-align: middle; text-align: center;"><a data-anchor="/document/118/202722/bssPhr21/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/202722/dfasiero70/" data-dfa="dfasiero70"></a><sup>(Ф.И.О)</sup></td></tr><tr><td style="vertical-align: middle; width: 180px;"><a data-anchor="/document/118/202722/dfas6skewv/" data-dfa="dfas6skewv"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/202722/bssPhr22/"></a><strong>Ознакомлен:</strong><span id="sfwc_1" class="sfwc"></span><span class="tooltip__wrapper"><span class="tooltip__point no-print"></span><span class="tooltip_text no-print"><a data-anchor="/document/118/202722/dfasurov3q/" data-dfa="dfasurov3q"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/202722/bssPhr23/"></a>Работник должен быть ознакомлен с&nbsp;приказом под подпись</span></span></td><td style="vertical-align: middle; width: 280px; text-align: center;"><span class="fill"></span></td><td style="vertical-align: middle; text-align: center;"><span class="fill"></span></td><td style="vertical-align: middle; text-align: center;"><a data-anchor="/document/118/202722/dfasf9ohwm/" data-dfa="dfasf9ohwm"></a></td></tr><tr><td style="vertical-align: middle; width: 180px;"><a data-anchor="/document/118/202722/bssPhr24/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/202722/dfasd3vy6l/" data-dfa="dfasd3vy6l"></a>Инженер ПТО</td><td class="bdBottom" style="vertical-align: middle; width: 280px; text-align: center;"><a data-anchor="/document/118/202722/dfashyuwdr/" data-dfa="dfashyuwdr"></a></td><td style="vertical-align: middle; text-align: center;"><span class="fill"></span></td><td class="bdBottom" style="vertical-align: middle; text-align: center;"><span class="fill"><span class="fill"><a data-anchor="/document/118/202722/bssPhr25/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/202722/dfaslxda80/" data-dfa="dfaslxda80"></a>К.Р. Кудратов</span>&nbsp;</span></td></tr><tr><td style="vertical-align: middle; width: 180px;"><a data-anchor="/document/118/202722/dfaso7leuh/" data-dfa="dfaso7leuh"></a></td><td class="bdTop" style="vertical-align: middle; width: 280px; text-align: center;"><a data-anchor="/document/118/202722/bssPhr26/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/202722/dfasoh1zuo/" data-dfa="dfasoh1zuo"></a><sup>(подпись)</sup></td><td style="vertical-align: middle;"><a data-anchor="/document/118/202722/dfashlp2k3/" data-dfa="dfashlp2k3"></a></td><td class="bdTop" style="vertical-align: middle; text-align: center;"><a data-anchor="/document/118/202722/bssPhr27/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/202722/dfasps5rki/" data-dfa="dfasps5rki"></a><sup>(Ф.И.О)</sup></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div><div class="footer">© Материал из ЭС "ACTION: Главбух"<br />https://1gb.uz<br />Дата копирования: 29.09.2026</div></div></div></div></body></html>